{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12898","headline":"送客还江东 · 韩翃","name":"送客还江东","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不妨高卧顺流归，五两行看扫翠微。\n鼯鼠夜喧孤枕近，鵁鶄晓避客船飞。\n一壶先醉桃枝簟，百和初熏苎布衣。\n君到新林江口泊，吟诗应赏谢玄晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}